<mj-text>Hi {{ customer.first_name | default: "there" }},</mj-text>
<mj-text>You haven't made a model yet, so here is the quickest way in.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If you have a picture of the object, use image-to-3D. One clear image on a plain background works best.</mj-text>
<mj-text>If you don't, use text-to-3D. Describe one object, its material and its style in a sentence.</mj-text>
<mj-text><a href="https://hydrilla.ai/app/studio">Open Studio</a></mj-text>
<mj-text>If something stopped you, reply and tell me. I read every reply.</mj-text>
<mj-text>Rishi<br />Creative Director, Hydrilla</mj-text>
